OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman told a police officer to "get
OL,7,Foff me" more than 300 times as he
OL,8,Fsubjected her to an 82-minute violent
OL,9,Frape in a Liverpool hotel room.
OL,11,FFormer Merseyside Police constable Ryan
OL,12,FTheaker, 30, was secretly recorded by
OL,13,Fthe victim after a night out in 2023.
OL,15,FThe woman, who cannot be named to
OL,16,Fprotect her anonymity, read an
OL,17,Femotional statement at Liverpool Crown
OL,18,FCourt and faced the dock as she told
OL,19,FTheaker "monsters never win".
